# dag-embeddings.json is the regenerable embedding cache (55 MB: 624 x
# 4096-dim vectors). It is a WORKING artifact, not a source: re-running
# utils/merge-dag-patterns.py without it re-embeds in ~3 min (16 requests)
# and reproduces the same clustering (the endpoint is deterministic to
# cosine distance ~0.0002 between calls, two orders of magnitude below the
# 0.15 merge threshold). Not committed to keep the repo lean (precedent:
# the largest committed research artifact, corpus.json, is 11.8 MB).
dag-embeddings.json
